Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:33:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 27/35] Report Bug: Ibasho's tracker moved to studio-quire

Help > Report Bug opens github.com/studio-quire/ibasho/issues, where the
project lives now.
---
 doc/IBASHO-CHANGES.txt                  | 2 +-
 indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/doc/IBASHO-CHANGES.txt b/doc/IBASHO-CHANGES.txt
index 014e168..e444c37 100644
--- a/doc/IBASHO-CHANGES.txt
+++ b/doc/IBASHO-CHANGES.txt
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@ indra/newview/CMakeLists.txt
 indra/newview/VIEWER_VERSION.txt
     Modified for Ibasho (2026-10-22): Ibasho's own version number (a data file read by CMake).
 indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
-    Modified for Ibasho (2026-10-10, 2026-10-11, 2026-10-22, 2026-10-23): settings for the Ibasho
+    Modified for Ibasho (2026-10-10, 2026-10-11, 2026-10-22, 2026-10-23, 2026-11-02): settings for the Ibasho
     LEAP APIs and limits (IbashoMaxPayment, IbashoMaxSessionSpend, IbashoMaxUploadCost,
     IbashoSpectator, IbashoNoActivate, IbashoMaxMessagesPerDay, IbashoAllowLandBuy,
     IbashoAllowCurrencyBuy); Report Bug goes to Ibasho's issue tracker (ReportBugURL); no release
diff --git a/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml b/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
index 9869f46..a185602 100644
--- a/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
+++ b/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 <?xml version="1.0" ?>
