+<!-- Modified for Ibasho (2026-10-10, 2026-10-11, 2026-10-22, 2026-10-23, 2026-11-02): settings for the Ibasho LEAP APIs and limits (IbashoMaxPayment, IbashoMaxSessionSpend, IbashoMaxUploadCost, IbashoSpectator, IbashoNoActivate, IbashoMaxMessagesPerDay, IbashoAllowLandBuy, IbashoAllowCurrencyBuy); Report Bug goes to Ibasho's issue tracker (ReportBugURL); no release notes pop up (UpdaterShowReleaseNotes). Changes are marked "Ibasho". -->
